(4923917, 714049, 81213, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Too dark for my taste, Can''t see much of his face at all, and there''s a lot of noise in the photo! try NeatImage...</td>', 'Hmmm... Too dark for my taste, Can''t see much of his face at all, and there''s a lot of noise in the photo! try NeatImage...', '2008-09-01 01:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4923919, 714846, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, but I worry that your processing is a bit over the top for DPC, making a lovely photograph into a great drawing.  I like it, but think you''re going to be disappointed with the votes you get.<br/> <br/>Still. . . looking at the photograph <i>under </i>the processing, I have to say that the detail is amazing and the composition is wonderful.  <br/> <br/>(I should also add that I see <i>why </i>you chose the processing that you did, and I really like your vision here, especially with the bottom left of the border.)<br/> <br/>Oh, BTW. . . 9  :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, but I worry that your processing is a bit over the top for DPC, making a lovely photograph into a great drawing.  I like it, but think you''re going to be disappointed with the votes you get. Still. . . looking at the photograph under the processing, I have to say that the detail is amazing and the composition is wonderful.   (I should also add that I see why you chose the processing that you did, and I really like your vision here, especially with the bottom left of the border.) Oh, BTW. . . 9  :)', '2008-09-01 01:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
