(4924050, 708040, 23484, '<td valign="top">Looks like the cover of a Moody Blues album.  I know, I''m showing my age. Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like the cover of a Moody Blues album.  I know, I''m showing my age. Nice job.', '2008-09-01 01:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
