(4924063, 716002, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Great job of drawing the eye in to the subject.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Great job of drawing the eye in to the subject.', '2008-09-01 01:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924065, 716964, 67553, '<td valign="top">I love it!  Forget the fact that it''s sharp as a tack and wonderfully composed. . . It made me chuckle!  This is a great shot!  There are 489 shots in this challenge.  I''m through 5 of them, and I already hope to see you on the front page!</td>', 'I love it!  Forget the fact that it''s sharp as a tack and wonderfully composed. . . It made me chuckle!  This is a great shot!  There are 489 shots in this challenge.  I''m through 5 of them, and I already hope to see you on the front page!', '2008-09-01 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924068, 708310, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition but it''s too blown out.</td>', 'This is a nice composition but it''s too blown out.', '2008-09-01 01:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924069, 712816, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the sun in the center horizontally. Fantastic silhouette.</td>', 'I love the sun in the center horizontally. Fantastic silhouette.', '2008-09-01 01:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924072, 714741, 23484, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective. Very well exposed.</td>', 'Terrific perspective. Very well exposed.', '2008-09-01 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924078, 714161, 23484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait.</td>', 'Fantastic portrait.', '2008-09-01 01:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924079, 714189, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the dust but feel more space is needed in front of the horse since that''s the direction of travel.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the dust but feel more space is needed in front of the horse since that''s the direction of travel.', '2008-09-01 01:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924084, 714871, 23484, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors.', '2008-09-01 01:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924086, 716748, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Simple elegance.</td>', 'Great capture. Simple elegance.', '2008-09-01 01:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924089, 708562, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot.</td>', 'Nice portrait shot.', '2008-09-01 01:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924092, 712442, 67553, '<td valign="top">I will give you props for the lighting here.  This almost looks like an indoor set, with the foreground and backdrop lighting absolutely perfect.  At the same time, I find it difficult to find a single focal point in this image and the colors are a bit drab.</td>', 'I will give you props for the lighting here.  This almost looks like an indoor set, with the foreground and backdrop lighting absolutely perfect.  At the same time, I find it difficult to find a single focal point in this image and the colors are a bit drab.', '2008-09-01 01:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924096, 716317, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.', '2008-09-01 01:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924099, 717046, 23484, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image.</td>', 'Gorgeous image.', '2008-09-01 01:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924104, 709789, 23484, '<td valign="top">Looks like old-time film. Nice capture.</td>', 'Looks like old-time film. Nice capture.', '2008-09-01 01:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924112, 713884, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. It''s too bad the trees don''t stand out more but fantastic shot non-the-less.</td>', 'Beautiful. It''s too bad the trees don''t stand out more but fantastic shot non-the-less.', '2008-09-01 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924116, 712443, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the sky.</td>', 'I love the sky.', '2008-09-01 01:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924117, 714119, 67553, '<td valign="top">First off, she''s beautiful and I would love to see the outtakes from this shoot.  Perhaps a close up with her looking into the camera. . . but I digress.  <br/> <br/>I really want to like this image, but I find that the centered composition detracts as does the B&amp;W treatment.  It really doesn''t leave enough contrast between the white of her dress and the surroundings for my taste.</td>', 'First off, she''s beautiful and I would love to see the outtakes from this shoot.  Perhaps a close up with her looking into the camera. . . but I digress.   I really want to like this image, but I find that the centered composition detracts as does the B&W treatment.  It really doesn''t leave enough contrast between the white of her dress and the surroundings for my taste.', '2008-09-01 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924118, 717057, 18197, '<td valign="top">You lost me with the sun and clouds. In all other respects, an extraordinary photo.</td>', 'You lost me with the sun and clouds. In all other respects, an extraordinary photo.', '2008-09-01 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924120, 715599, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great swamp shot. Very nicely exposed.</td>', 'Great swamp shot. Very nicely exposed.', '2008-09-01 01:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924126, 708562, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is great, love the soft, high key tone of the skin. Lovely pose. I don''t like the line coming out her cheek! Well done, good luck. To my favs...</td>', 'This is great, love the soft, high key tone of the skin. Lovely pose. I don''t like the line coming out her cheek! Well done, good luck. To my favs...', '2008-09-01 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924127, 716983, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job on that capture. This could be in National Geographic.</td>', 'Great job on that capture. This could be in National Geographic.', '2008-09-01 01:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924129, 706562, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot.</td>', 'Nice portrait shot.', '2008-09-01 01:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924134, 716250, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.</td>', 'I like the lighting.', '2008-09-01 01:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924147, 716709, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job.</td>', 'Nice job.', '2008-09-01 01:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924153, 716525, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great fisheye.</td>', 'Great fisheye.', '2008-09-01 01:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924158, 716619, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like this image. Very mysterious, she did a good job projecting fear and distrust of the viewer. I must admit I don''t like the center composition, as I think the window would have been more interesting than the left 1/3 of negative space. The PP is excellent, I love the mood you created. 7</td>', 'I like this image. Very mysterious, she did a good job projecting fear and distrust of the viewer. I must admit I don''t like the center composition, as I think the window would have been more interesting than the left 1/3 of negative space. The PP is excellent, I love the mood you created. 7', '2008-09-01 01:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924179, 717055, 67553, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with this image.  There is a great panoply of color and the composition is pleasing.  Even the sky is cooperating with the lines drawing the eye to the main subject at the end of the pier.  <br/> <br/>My only wish here would be to see more detail in the house.  I think this might give the image a much more <i>active </i>main subject as it seems to be almost lacking one as is.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with this image.  There is a great panoply of color and the composition is pleasing.  Even the sky is cooperating with the lines drawing the eye to the main subject at the end of the pier.   My only wish here would be to see more detail in the house.  I think this might give the image a much more active main subject as it seems to be almost lacking one as is.', '2008-09-01 01:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924181, 716882, 23484, '<td valign="top">The rays of light are fantastic. Wonderful image.</td>', 'The rays of light are fantastic. Wonderful image.', '2008-09-01 01:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924189, 716169, 67553, '<td valign="top">She''s a pretty girl, but other than that, I don''t see a lot making this image stand out from the crowd.<br/> <br/>I do like the sharpness of the main subject and the effective use of DOF to isolate her from the background, though.</td>', 'She''s a pretty girl, but other than that, I don''t see a lot making this image stand out from the crowd. I do like the sharpness of the main subject and the effective use of DOF to isolate her from the background, though.', '2008-09-01 02:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924190, 712443, 60495, '<td valign="top">Very serene setting, not sure I like they way it crops on the right side but still a nice image. 6</td>', 'Very serene setting, not sure I like they way it crops on the right side but still a nice image. 6', '2008-09-01 02:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924200, 716403, 67553, '<td valign="top">While I like your composition and choice of subject, there is not a lot to make this image stand out <i>here</i>.  The colors are a little subdued, and the main subject does not really <i>pop</i>.</td>', 'While I like your composition and choice of subject, there is not a lot to make this image stand out here.  The colors are a little subdued, and the main subject does not really pop.', '2008-09-01 02:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924205, 716638, 67553, '<td valign="top">Seems a little early to start steering to the left.  Seriously. . . Dude!  Go straight!  <br/> <br/>Ok, I really like this one.  It''s not really a new idea, but I guess that having the right gear makes all the difference!</td>', 'Seems a little early to start steering to the left.  Seriously. . . Dude!  Go straight!   Ok, I really like this one.  It''s not really a new idea, but I guess that having the right gear makes all the difference!', '2008-09-01 02:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924210, 716662, 67553, '<td valign="top">You should have ordered up some clear blue skies for this one!  (OK, I suppose there are some things that you can''t control.)  <br/> <br/>Good composition, and clarity.</td>', 'You should have ordered up some clear blue skies for this one!  (OK, I suppose there are some things that you can''t control.)   Good composition, and clarity.', '2008-09-01 02:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924211, 708037, 7565, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, great detail, the centre composition doesn''t work for me but still a nice image.</td>', 'Nice colours, great detail, the centre composition doesn''t work for me but still a nice image.', '2008-09-01 02:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924214, 706562, 67553, '<td valign="top">Shirt wins!<br/> <br/>I might have tilted the image CCW a bit to straighten out the wall on the left, but good use of DOF to isolate the subject.  (Pretty girl, BTW!)</td>', 'Shirt wins! I might have tilted the image CCW a bit to straighten out the wall on the left, but good use of DOF to isolate the subject.  (Pretty girl, BTW!)', '2008-09-01 02:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924221, 713884, 67553, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love it!  How did you get them both to pose in such perfect spots?<br/> <br/>Seriously, the obvious motion of the deer in the background gives a sense of motion to the duck in the foreground, making the entire image very dynamic and a bit surreal.  Very well done!</td>', 'Wow!  Love it!  How did you get them both to pose in such perfect spots? Seriously, the obvious motion of the deer in the background gives a sense of motion to the duck in the foreground, making the entire image very dynamic and a bit surreal.  Very well done!', '2008-09-01 02:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
