(4924334, 716901, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this except for one thing. There are some visible JPEG compression artifacts showing. Mostly visible in the high contrast areas where the sky meets the train. You filesize of 107k (challenge limit is 200k) indicates you had a lot more overhead available, and if you had used less compression, you could have eliminated those artifacts. More than likely, nobody but me will notice it, but it does rob some fine detail.</td>', 'I like this except for one thing. There are some visible JPEG compression artifacts showing. Mostly visible in the high contrast areas where the sky meets the train. You filesize of 107k (challenge limit is 200k) indicates you had a lot more overhead available, and if you had used less compression, you could have eliminated those artifacts. More than likely, nobody but me will notice it, but it does rob some fine detail.', '2008-09-01 02:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
