(4924419, 714844, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is very blurred and unclear. Most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 17k indicates an extremely compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)<br/> <br/>You image size is also only 640 pixels, and you could have used 720 pixels for this challenge.</td>', 'This is very blurred and unclear. Most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 17k indicates an extremely compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one) You image size is also only 640 pixels, and you could have used 720 pixels for this challenge.', '2008-09-01 03:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
