(4925049, 706325, 67553, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  It works really well in B&amp;W, and the processing is perfect.  Great contrast, and his eyes really shine.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like this image.  It works really well in B&W, and the processing is perfect.  Great contrast, and his eyes really shine.  Nicely done!', '2008-09-01 09:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
