(4926252, 716701, 67553, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark, but with the sharpness and clarity you have captured here, it gives the entire image sort of a high-tech brooding look.  If that makes no sense, let''s just go with ''I like the mood this image sets.''  :)</td>', 'It''s a little dark, but with the sharpness and clarity you have captured here, it gives the entire image sort of a high-tech brooding look.  If that makes no sense, let''s just go with ''I like the mood this image sets.''  :)', '2008-09-01 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
