(4926269, 714234, 67553, '<td valign="top">That is a very bright street.  I thought at first glance that it was a bit too much, but as I look at this longer, I find that I like it a lot.  So much so, that I might suggest cropping out everything in the photo <i>below </i>the bright streak, making it a photo about the wider city rather than individual cars or streets.  Either way, this is a nice image with a lot of detail that needs to be studied to be properly appreciated.</td>', 'That is a very bright street.  I thought at first glance that it was a bit too much, but as I look at this longer, I find that I like it a lot.  So much so, that I might suggest cropping out everything in the photo below the bright streak, making it a photo about the wider city rather than individual cars or streets.  Either way, this is a nice image with a lot of detail that needs to be studied to be properly appreciated.', '2008-09-01 18:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4926275, 716766, 67553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the contrast between the subject and the white background.  This is nicely lit as well.  Some of the tips are slightly OOF on one side or the other but I don''t think it actually detracts from the overall image significantly.</td>', 'I like the composition and the contrast between the subject and the white background.  This is nicely lit as well.  Some of the tips are slightly OOF on one side or the other but I don''t think it actually detracts from the overall image significantly.', '2008-09-01 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
