(4927371, 708929, 63633, '<td valign="top">This has some amazing elements, but for some reason they don''t work together for me. I think it''s the composition, but if I managed that capture and the composition was a bit off, I''d submit it too! :P</td>', 'This has some amazing elements, but for some reason they don''t work together for me. I think it''s the composition, but if I managed that capture and the composition was a bit off, I''d submit it too! :P', '2008-09-02 08:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927372, 716177, 63633, '<td valign="top">10/10 for humour, 7/10 for the photo. Funniest DPC entry I''ve seen for a long time!<br/> <br/>That was supposed to be 10/10 for humour- sorry!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-08 20:07:18.</i></td>', '10/10 for humour, 7/10 for the photo. Funniest DPC entry I''ve seen for a long time! That was supposed to be 10/10 for humour- sorry!', '2008-09-02 08:55:43.000000', '2008-09-08 21:07:18.000000', 1),
(4927373, 710998, 63633, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many "needs straightening" comments you''re going to get? :) Great fun mood to this image.</td>', 'Wonder how many "needs straightening" comments you''re going to get? :) Great fun mood to this image.', '2008-09-02 08:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927376, 716527, 23484, '<td valign="top">They look like they''re coming out of the darkness. Nice shot.</td>', 'They look like they''re coming out of the darkness. Nice shot.', '2008-09-02 08:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927378, 716943, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job. Great composition. I''m a sucker for high contrast B&amp;W. Love it. 9</td>', 'Great job. Great composition. I''m a sucker for high contrast B&W. Love it. 9', '2008-09-02 09:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927379, 706085, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely crisp focus, and nice use of colour.</td>', 'Lovely crisp focus, and nice use of colour.', '2008-09-02 09:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927381, 716364, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Nice execution.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Nice execution.', '2008-09-02 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927388, 715803, 39430, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this image stands out as being different, and the title links really well to the image.  Both halves of the quote contain elements in this image.  However, the more I look at the image, the more I want from it.  It seems to stop at the first powerful glance.  To try for some technical suggestions, maybe it is something odd about the crop with the faces so close to the top, but for the shot taken, the crop is probably right - the heads, the uniforms, the handrail and hands, it all needs to be there, and nothing more.  I do like the dark blue colouring.</td>', 'At first glance, this image stands out as being different, and the title links really well to the image.  Both halves of the quote contain elements in this image.  However, the more I look at the image, the more I want from it.  It seems to stop at the first powerful glance.  To try for some technical suggestions, maybe it is something odd about the crop with the faces so close to the top, but for the shot taken, the crop is probably right - the heads, the uniforms, the handrail and hands, it all needs to be there, and nothing more.  I do like the dark blue colouring.', '2008-09-02 09:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927389, 715796, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very "ansel".  :)</td>', 'Very "ansel".  :)', '2008-09-02 09:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927402, 716672, 63633, '<td valign="top">Poor froggy! Great capture :)</td>', 'Poor froggy! Great capture :)', '2008-09-02 09:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927407, 708798, 63633, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are amazing!</td>', 'Her eyes are amazing!', '2008-09-02 09:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927416, 716680, 39430, '<td valign="top">I feel this image probably lost something in BW, and might have been better in colour?</td>', 'I feel this image probably lost something in BW, and might have been better in colour?', '2008-09-02 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927418, 716241, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot.  I love the wet-hair.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot.  I love the wet-hair.', '2008-09-02 09:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927420, 717055, 39430, '<td valign="top">Classic DPC eye-candy.  :)  Great colours, and nice balance of natural light with the artificial</td>', 'Classic DPC eye-candy.  :)  Great colours, and nice balance of natural light with the artificial', '2008-09-02 09:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927421, 716002, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Might not fare as well as it deserves with the DPC voters, but I like it.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Might not fare as well as it deserves with the DPC voters, but I like it.', '2008-09-02 09:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927423, 714531, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great colours, and nice skin smoothing.  The colours may just be a little oversaturated, particularly where it has blown out the red on his shoulder.</td>', 'Great colours, and nice skin smoothing.  The colours may just be a little oversaturated, particularly where it has blown out the red on his shoulder.', '2008-09-02 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927424, 708461, 63633, '<td valign="top">Love it! Pity about the picture rail.</td>', 'Love it! Pity about the picture rail.', '2008-09-02 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927425, 716586, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Some extra editing would help bring the squirrel out more from the background, but apart from that, very nice.</td>', 'Great composition.  Some extra editing would help bring the squirrel out more from the background, but apart from that, very nice.', '2008-09-02 09:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927427, 708713, 39430, '<td valign="top">Lovely glow and a crisp result.</td>', 'Lovely glow and a crisp result.', '2008-09-02 09:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927431, 716339, 39430, '<td valign="top">The editing has been just a little overdone with the contrast and saturation on the foreground.  There''s a lovely colour in the sea which could be brought out more.</td>', 'The editing has been just a little overdone with the contrast and saturation on the foreground.  There''s a lovely colour in the sea which could be brought out more.', '2008-09-02 09:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927432, 713874, 63633, '<td valign="top">Ah!! Nice, happy clowns :)</td>', 'Ah!! Nice, happy clowns :)', '2008-09-02 09:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927436, 714870, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment.  It kind of scary how young the driver looks, but it really adds to the shot, his slight fear, but absolute trust in the wise voice of experience to direct his youthful bravado and reflexes.  You''ve captured a lot in his eyes.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment.  It kind of scary how young the driver looks, but it really adds to the shot, his slight fear, but absolute trust in the wise voice of experience to direct his youthful bravado and reflexes.  You''ve captured a lot in his eyes.', '2008-09-02 09:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927439, 714177, 63633, '<td valign="top">Only just noticed the real bird on the right - great!</td>', 'Only just noticed the real bird on the right - great!', '2008-09-02 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927440, 712421, 39430, '<td valign="top">The small size and black and white don''t really do this image justice, which is a pity.</td>', 'The small size and black and white don''t really do this image justice, which is a pity.', '2008-09-02 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927449, 716615, 39430, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would help to focus in on her face more.  You could crop more of the bottom and left.</td>', 'A closer crop would help to focus in on her face more.  You could crop more of the bottom and left.', '2008-09-02 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927450, 710155, 63633, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!</td>', 'Breathtaking!', '2008-09-02 09:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927453, 717038, 39430, '<td valign="top">This looks a little to glamourous for a corporate headshot, but still a very nice shot.  Focus is perfect.</td>', 'This looks a little to glamourous for a corporate headshot, but still a very nice shot.  Focus is perfect.', '2008-09-02 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927462, 715497, 39430, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Beautiful colours and tones!</td>', 'I love this!  Beautiful colours and tones!', '2008-09-02 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927468, 712920, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice location, and great reflection.  Some curves adjustment would help to bring out more detail in the rocks.</td>', 'Nice location, and great reflection.  Some curves adjustment would help to bring out more detail in the rocks.', '2008-09-02 09:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927473, 716469, 39430, '<td valign="top">Noise reduction has taken most of the small detail out of this image, which is a pity.</td>', 'Noise reduction has taken most of the small detail out of this image, which is a pity.', '2008-09-02 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4927476, 710706, 39430, '<td valign="top">Colours are just a touch oversaturated, but a beautiful image.</td>', 'Colours are just a touch oversaturated, but a beautiful image.', '2008-09-02 09:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
