(4927591, 713154, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ah, man!  Too bad the focal point is just off a tad - this would be stunning.</td>', 'Ah, man!  Too bad the focal point is just off a tad - this would be stunning.', '2008-09-02 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
