(4927981, 715803, 77192, '<td valign="top">A nice title (I should recognise the quote but I''m afraid I don''t) and fits the plight of these brave men and women perfectly. There is a combination of natural trepidation but resoluteness in your subjects, particularly the main focal point of the young man second from the right. I like the way you''ve shot them from the side, giving the photo physical depth to go with the emotional depth in the shot.<br/> <br/>Very well done. One of my top picks for the challenge. in fact a 10 from me.</td>', 'A nice title (I should recognise the quote but I''m afraid I don''t) and fits the plight of these brave men and women perfectly. There is a combination of natural trepidation but resoluteness in your subjects, particularly the main focal point of the young man second from the right. I like the way you''ve shot them from the side, giving the photo physical depth to go with the emotional depth in the shot. Very well done. One of my top picks for the challenge. in fact a 10 from me.', '2008-09-02 15:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
