(4928704, 716412, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a really good capture!  I like the astounding level of detail shown, and the blurring of the wings coupled with the slight angle give this image a dynamic feeling.  I don''t care for the condition of the flower, as it''s looking a little worn, but I think the main subject here is the bug.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a really good capture!  I like the astounding level of detail shown, and the blurring of the wings coupled with the slight angle give this image a dynamic feeling.  I don''t care for the condition of the flower, as it''s looking a little worn, but I think the main subject here is the bug.  Well done.', '2008-09-02 20:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4928710, 716669, 67553, '<td valign="top">He''s cool!  You are spot on with the focus, and I really like the way the focus falls off behind him.  This very colorful image is technically flawless.  I even like the border.</td>', 'He''s cool!  You are spot on with the focus, and I really like the way the focus falls off behind him.  This very colorful image is technically flawless.  I even like the border.', '2008-09-02 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
