(4932687, 717060, 67553, '<td valign="top">This popped up and I thought, "Abstract in a free study?  Better be good!"<br/> <br/>So, I stopped to look. . . .<br/> <br/>Then I looked some more.<br/> <br/>Then I realized exactly how creepy this image is.<br/> <br/>Once I was done being creeped out, I looked at the technicals. . . (the lighting is awesome, BTW!)<br/> <br/>Finally, I came to the conclusion that I really, really like this image!  This is very well conceived, lit and executed.  One of my favorites so far!</td>', 'This popped up and I thought, "Abstract in a free study?  Better be good!" So, I stopped to look. . . . Then I looked some more. Then I realized exactly how creepy this image is. Once I was done being creeped out, I looked at the technicals. . . (the lighting is awesome, BTW!) Finally, I came to the conclusion that I really, really like this image!  This is very well conceived, lit and executed.  One of my favorites so far!', '2008-09-03 22:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
