(4933195, 713163, 90495, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot. Her look is captivating in that it keeps your attention, I don''t want to look away. My problem lies in the b&amp;w conversion. It lacks true blacks. Her pupils should be totally black, they aren''t. It looks too flat for it to have impact as a b&amp;w image. I would love to see the colour version.</td>', 'Well composed shot. Her look is captivating in that it keeps your attention, I don''t want to look away. My problem lies in the b&w conversion. It lacks true blacks. Her pupils should be totally black, they aren''t. It looks too flat for it to have impact as a b&w image. I would love to see the colour version.', '2008-09-04 00:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
