(4933790, 716691, 58272, '<td valign="top">Touching moment, the pinks/reds in the skin here are a bit intense, or at least they dont go overly well with the greens in the shot.This might be more pleasing as a b&amp;w.</td>', 'Touching moment, the pinks/reds in the skin here are a bit intense, or at least they dont go overly well with the greens in the shot.This might be more pleasing as a b&w.', '2008-09-04 10:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
