(4933798, 716576, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  Another Horse(s) outtake?  :-)  Horses are quite popular in this month''s Free Study.<br/> <br/>The compositional decision is either a like/don''t like scenario.  The horse is looking directly out of the frame (being that it''s on the edge).  Some will like the intrique factor ("what''s he looking at?"), others will not like the fact that the viewer is immediately directed outside the frame rather than being directed within the photo.<br/> <br/>Just some observations.  :-)  BTW - I nearly missed the bg fencing.  Is that part of the titling choice?<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He-he.  Another Horse(s) outtake?  :-)  Horses are quite popular in this month''s Free Study. The compositional decision is either a like/don''t like scenario.  The horse is looking directly out of the frame (being that it''s on the edge).  Some will like the intrique factor ("what''s he looking at?"), others will not like the fact that the viewer is immediately directed outside the frame rather than being directed within the photo. Just some observations.  :-)  BTW - I nearly missed the bg fencing.  Is that part of the titling choice? Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-09-04 10:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4933801, 708798, 96924, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautifully exposed photograph. I feel though, that the reflections in the eyes are distracting.</td>', 'This is a really beautifully exposed photograph. I feel though, that the reflections in the eyes are distracting.', '2008-09-04 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4933802, 716539, 30791, '<td valign="top">awesome white balance correction, must have been slided down to like 2000K or something<br/>great image</td>', 'awesome white balance correction, must have been slided down to like 2000K or somethinggreat image', '2008-09-04 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4933804, 716557, 58272, '<td valign="top">This is very emotive. The b&amp;w works well, I imagine this looks quite nice in colour as well. There seems to be a slight halo around the boy, sharpening? or is the DOF engineered in pp?</td>', 'This is very emotive. The b&w works well, I imagine this looks quite nice in colour as well. There seems to be a slight halo around the boy, sharpening? or is the DOF engineered in pp?', '2008-09-04 10:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4933805, 716878, 30049, '<td valign="top">Your patience paid off.  Nice catch!</td>', 'Your patience paid off.  Nice catch!', '2008-09-04 10:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
