(4933816, 710357, 30049, '<td valign="top">The composition is fine on this.  May be a tad tight on the left curve nearly bumping the left side of the frame.  From the POV you chose the horizon is nearly centered.  A lower profile on this would be interesting.<br/> <br/>This photo appears to be quite natural, which is fine overall for the family album of a vacation destination, etc...  A little more tweaking in post-processing would elevate this for the DPC voters IMO.  After the challenge is over, post this image in a forum for feedback, suggestions, ideas, and see what you get.  You''ll be amazed by the editing choices and results others'' may bring to this.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The composition is fine on this.  May be a tad tight on the left curve nearly bumping the left side of the frame.  From the POV you chose the horizon is nearly centered.  A lower profile on this would be interesting. This photo appears to be quite natural, which is fine overall for the family album of a vacation destination, etc...  A little more tweaking in post-processing would elevate this for the DPC voters IMO.  After the challenge is over, post this image in a forum for feedback, suggestions, ideas, and see what you get.  You''ll be amazed by the editing choices and results others'' may bring to this. All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-09-04 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
