(4933937, 712539, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait.', '2008-09-04 11:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934041, 715220, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the way the staircase leads your eye around the photo. If you were more square on to the wall, I think the geometric shapes in the image would have created a more powerful effect.</td>', 'I love the way the staircase leads your eye around the photo. If you were more square on to the wall, I think the geometric shapes in the image would have created a more powerful effect.', '2008-09-04 12:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934043, 714585, 46314, '<td valign="top">The look of malice in his face and the pose create a lot of energy in this image. I like the subdued colour and strong contrast - adds to the feel of evil craziness.</td>', 'The look of malice in his face and the pose create a lot of energy in this image. I like the subdued colour and strong contrast - adds to the feel of evil craziness.', '2008-09-04 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934046, 716458, 46314, '<td valign="top">All the horizontal lines (the alternating shadows and treeline) are sloping off towards the right. It makes me feel a little uneasy. I think level horizontals might have allowed the viewer to focus more on the angler.</td>', 'All the horizontal lines (the alternating shadows and treeline) are sloping off towards the right. It makes me feel a little uneasy. I think level horizontals might have allowed the viewer to focus more on the angler.', '2008-09-04 12:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934051, 714190, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love that bold sweep of land spanning horizontally. Makes the image quite dynamic.</td>', 'I love that bold sweep of land spanning horizontally. Makes the image quite dynamic.', '2008-09-04 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934056, 717055, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love finely detailed silhouettes like this. Nice composition and colour palette.</td>', 'I love finely detailed silhouettes like this. Nice composition and colour palette.', '2008-09-04 13:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934066, 716627, 46314, '<td valign="top">You did an excellent job of controlling the tone in this b&amp;w image, but I don''t know if the monochrome really helps it. It sterilizes the unclean building and graffiti too much, and so I think the building loses a bit of its impact as a run-down relic. Well taken though.</td>', 'You did an excellent job of controlling the tone in this b&w image, but I don''t know if the monochrome really helps it. It sterilizes the unclean building and graffiti too much, and so I think the building loses a bit of its impact as a run-down relic. Well taken though.', '2008-09-04 13:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934074, 714053, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken. Although the B+W emphasises the strong shape of the bird, I also feel it drains a bit of the life out of the creature - I''d like to have seen what it looks like in colour.</td>', 'Nicely taken. Although the B+W emphasises the strong shape of the bird, I also feel it drains a bit of the life out of the creature - I''d like to have seen what it looks like in colour.', '2008-09-04 13:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934082, 714947, 46314, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just the mood I''m in tonight, but I keep seeing b+w photos that I wish were in colour because they''d make the subject seem so much more alive and vibrant. Kids are great models - I''d prefer to see them in a more colourful lively scene, than this one which is more sterile and artsy (although well taken and processed).</td>', 'Maybe it''s just the mood I''m in tonight, but I keep seeing b+w photos that I wish were in colour because they''d make the subject seem so much more alive and vibrant. Kids are great models - I''d prefer to see them in a more colourful lively scene, than this one which is more sterile and artsy (although well taken and processed).', '2008-09-04 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934086, 716999, 46314, '<td valign="top">This image disturbs me. Maybe it''s just the juxtaposition of teddy bears and graves... Still, I find what you did with the lighting and the use of negative space very interesting. Nice work.</td>', 'This image disturbs me. Maybe it''s just the juxtaposition of teddy bears and graves... Still, I find what you did with the lighting and the use of negative space very interesting. Nice work.', '2008-09-04 13:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934091, 708034, 46314, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful scene. Something about the composition doesn''t feel balanced enough to me, and maybe the peaks of the mountain aren''t quite sharp enough. There is a lot of detail lost in those dark tones, yet somehow I like the mood it creates.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful scene. Something about the composition doesn''t feel balanced enough to me, and maybe the peaks of the mountain aren''t quite sharp enough. There is a lot of detail lost in those dark tones, yet somehow I like the mood it creates.', '2008-09-04 13:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934098, 716641, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat. Maybe a square crop would have done away with that empty blackness on the left and emphasised those remarkable eyes more. Still, a nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful cat. Maybe a square crop would have done away with that empty blackness on the left and emphasised those remarkable eyes more. Still, a nice shot.', '2008-09-04 13:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934103, 714745, 46314, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit off. Those kids either seem to be in the way, or are not there enough... I like the sculpture though - that''s a work of art. And you chose the right lighting to show off all its angles.</td>', 'The composition is a bit off. Those kids either seem to be in the way, or are not there enough... I like the sculpture though - that''s a work of art. And you chose the right lighting to show off all its angles.', '2008-09-04 13:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934110, 717025, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours. Almost seems like a painterly effect applied to the image. But overall it just seems a little cluttered to me, and I don''t like how her eyes are obscured by the reflection in her glasses.</td>', 'Interesting colours. Almost seems like a painterly effect applied to the image. But overall it just seems a little cluttered to me, and I don''t like how her eyes are obscured by the reflection in her glasses.', '2008-09-04 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
