(4934114, 716574, 62357, '<td valign="top">Wish I could vote on this one!  I hope it''s tipped over the 6  by now Mark!!  It''s so clear and well focused.  By the way, when was it sunny in the UK??</td>', 'Wish I could vote on this one!  I hope it''s tipped over the 6  by now Mark!!  It''s so clear and well focused.  By the way, when was it sunny in the UK??', '2008-09-04 13:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
