(4934561, 716672, 79720, '<td valign="top">Love it. The title is total synchronicity with what I was just thinking. Looks like a simple garter snake, what''s he doing trying to eat a frog? The focus and clarity is superb.</td>', 'Love it. The title is total synchronicity with what I was just thinking. Looks like a simple garter snake, what''s he doing trying to eat a frog? The focus and clarity is superb.', '2008-09-04 16:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
