(4935595, 715368, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice shot.  I''m assuming the DOF was added in post-processing, but it looks cool, like it is a photo of a tiny model city.  Hey, wait, I recognise some landmarks there, and the photographic style fits...hello <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a>.  :)</td>', 'Wow, nice shot.  I''m assuming the DOF was added in post-processing, but it looks cool, like it is a photo of a tiny model city.  Hey, wait, I recognise some landmarks there, and the photographic style fits...hello  hotpasta.  :)', '2008-09-05 02:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
