(4935609, 716575, 39430, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great image, but I don''t like the processing.  You''ve taken it a little too far with the contrast.  This also looks like it might be a good image with the colour left in.  Unless I''m missing some significant hidden meaning, the title should be "Sheep", not "Sheeps".  :)</td>', 'Looks like a great image, but I don''t like the processing.  You''ve taken it a little too far with the contrast.  This also looks like it might be a good image with the colour left in.  Unless I''m missing some significant hidden meaning, the title should be "Sheep", not "Sheeps".  :)', '2008-09-05 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935611, 716587, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too oversaturated for my liking.</td>', 'This is a bit too oversaturated for my liking.', '2008-09-05 02:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
