(4935617, 716906, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp - possibly a slow shutter speed?  I find shots like this in the shade should be ISO 400 or higher just to get a decent shutter speed with a longer lens.</td>', 'Not quite sharp - possibly a slow shutter speed?  I find shots like this in the shade should be ISO 400 or higher just to get a decent shutter speed with a longer lens.', '2008-09-05 02:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
