(4935625, 716496, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s something wrong about the reflections going off at an angle like that.  Also, be very careful with colour casts on night images.  Artificial lights are really tricky to get right.  Tungsten or flouro white balance can help, although I often go with auto, and then fix the colour balance in photoshop.  The colouring here is a little on the bluish side.</td>', 'There''s something wrong about the reflections going off at an angle like that.  Also, be very careful with colour casts on night images.  Artificial lights are really tricky to get right.  Tungsten or flouro white balance can help, although I often go with auto, and then fix the colour balance in photoshop.  The colouring here is a little on the bluish side.', '2008-09-05 02:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935630, 709072, 39430, '<td valign="top">Do you mean "Majestic"?  Nice shot, but the shadows are a little dark.</td>', 'Do you mean "Majestic"?  Nice shot, but the shadows are a little dark.', '2008-09-05 02:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
