(4935971, 710357, 46314, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The subdued colours, and the fine details make it a really pretty seaside scene. Looks like a vintage photograph.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The subdued colours, and the fine details make it a really pretty seaside scene. Looks like a vintage photograph.', '2008-09-05 09:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4935975, 712187, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The use of the water makes it quite different to most ''eye detail'' shots I''ve seen. I might have preferred if there was a bit more lighting around the eye to bring out some of the detail lost in that black spot. Still, it was well taken and has quite a distinctive look.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The use of the water makes it quite different to most ''eye detail'' shots I''ve seen. I might have preferred if there was a bit more lighting around the eye to bring out some of the detail lost in that black spot. Still, it was well taken and has quite a distinctive look.', '2008-09-05 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4936012, 713057, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot. Lighting is great, and the subject is nicely posed and composed.</td>', 'Nicely shot. Lighting is great, and the subject is nicely posed and composed.', '2008-09-05 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4936023, 714482, 46314, '<td valign="top">The blown out highlights at the back are a bit distracting, though I kinda like the perspective that is created by the poles behind her.</td>', 'The blown out highlights at the back are a bit distracting, though I kinda like the perspective that is created by the poles behind her.', '2008-09-05 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
