(4936145, 708929, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, this is one of those shots I may have preferred see in color. The one distraction for me is the darkness of the rock towards the center of the shot makes it feel somewhat centered even though it is not. If the rock on that edge were lighter and maybe a slight change in the cropping it might help IMHO but still a very cool shot.</td>', 'Nice capture, this is one of those shots I may have preferred see in color. The one distraction for me is the darkness of the rock towards the center of the shot makes it feel somewhat centered even though it is not. If the rock on that edge were lighter and maybe a slight change in the cropping it might help IMHO but still a very cool shot.', '2008-09-05 11:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4936149, 712591, 60495, '<td valign="top">Always good to have a stunt woman for a model, nicely done</td>', 'Always good to have a stunt woman for a model, nicely done', '2008-09-05 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4936150, 716929, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like what you did with this shot, very nice lighting and works well in b&amp;w.</td>', 'I like what you did with this shot, very nice lighting and works well in b&w.', '2008-09-05 11:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
