(4936176, 715710, 32378, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this.  I''m not a horse expert but I think I would have liked a little more in the frame on the left side.  For a second I wasn''t sure if head belonged to the body in the back ground.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this.  I''m not a horse expert but I think I would have liked a little more in the frame on the left side.  For a second I wasn''t sure if head belonged to the body in the back ground.', '2008-09-05 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
