(4937630, 717036, 73452, '<td valign="top">i''ve read a few tutorials about fireworks, and to not catch the aftermath of the clouds, you put a black card in front of the lens till it goes away, but you have to use a longer shutter.  i tink thats what bothers me most about the image, is the bright cloud.  other then that, very nicely composed</td>', 'i''ve read a few tutorials about fireworks, and to not catch the aftermath of the clouds, you put a black card in front of the lens till it goes away, but you have to use a longer shutter.  i tink thats what bothers me most about the image, is the bright cloud.  other then that, very nicely composed', '2008-09-06 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937631, 716632, 73452, '<td valign="top">nice work, but i wish the whole left of the island was visible.  only a nit=pick though</td>', 'nice work, but i wish the whole left of the island was visible.  only a nit=pick though', '2008-09-06 03:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
