(4937635, 712731, 73452, '<td valign="top">not sure what the main focus was in this photo.  colors are a little bland.<br/>i really dont want to sound mean.  sorry.</td>', 'not sure what the main focus was in this photo.  colors are a little bland.i really dont want to sound mean.  sorry.', '2008-09-06 03:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
