(4937641, 713676, 37858, '<td valign="top">That looks like Portlock and the back side of Hanoma Bay.  Nice capture of the moonrise.  I might have tried to clone out what may be a slight flare to the right of the moon.  I love the three stars in the upper center.  Good work.  (Now if I can only figure out where you were standing when you took this one....)</td>', 'That looks like Portlock and the back side of Hanoma Bay.  Nice capture of the moonrise.  I might have tried to clone out what may be a slight flare to the right of the moon.  I love the three stars in the upper center.  Good work.  (Now if I can only figure out where you were standing when you took this one....)', '2008-09-06 03:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937642, 716177, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the straight-on composition in this one.</td>', 'I like the straight-on composition in this one.', '2008-09-06 03:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4937644, 713939, 37858, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing.  Those clouds on the horizon are magnificent.</td>', 'Lovely processing.  Those clouds on the horizon are magnificent.', '2008-09-06 03:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
