(4938836, 714381, 46314, '<td valign="top">Seems like a happy scene. Came back and bumped up my vote a bit... Something about the child''s expression, or the way you captured the scene really grabs me. I can almost hear the noise and the laughter in the scene. I''m sure a lot of people will overlook this one, or write it off as out of focus, but I really feel something from this image. It''s not a ribbon winner, but I appreciate it.</td>', 'Seems like a happy scene. Came back and bumped up my vote a bit... Something about the child''s expression, or the way you captured the scene really grabs me. I can almost hear the noise and the laughter in the scene. I''m sure a lot of people will overlook this one, or write it off as out of focus, but I really feel something from this image. It''s not a ribbon winner, but I appreciate it.', '2008-09-06 20:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
