(4939852, 715274, 65234, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  Great title :-)))  Wonderfully odd pose.  Shot is a little soft but that''s OK; it''s a baby.  I might''ve dodged the catchlights in the eye to strengthen the impact of the eye contact on the viewer.</td>', 'ROFL!  Great title :-)))  Wonderfully odd pose.  Shot is a little soft but that''s OK; it''s a baby.  I might''ve dodged the catchlights in the eye to strengthen the impact of the eye contact on the viewer.', '2008-09-07 13:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
