(4939855, 715516, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry, although you''ve left more on the bottom than the top.  Tricky lighting conditions too, but you''ve done pretty well. This shot begs for multi-exposure on a tripod and then done up in photomatix or similar for a nice HDR look. (not DPC legal, but would look great in a personal album)</td>', 'Nice symmetry, although you''ve left more on the bottom than the top.  Tricky lighting conditions too, but you''ve done pretty well. This shot begs for multi-exposure on a tripod and then done up in photomatix or similar for a nice HDR look. (not DPC legal, but would look great in a personal album)', '2008-09-07 13:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939856, 711244, 97166, '<td valign="top">lacks a little contrast and, by association, some sharpness in the shadows.<br/> <br/>The sun''s star effect is quite a nice little bonus.</td>', 'lacks a little contrast and, by association, some sharpness in the shadows. The sun''s star effect is quite a nice little bonus.', '2008-09-07 13:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
