(4939860, 716627, 97166, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate.  Looks like it would have been a nifty little spot to eat. I like the attempt at a dramatic choice of perspective, but the bright light of the time of day doesn''t really work with the subject that feels like it wants to be dark and moody.</td>', 'Unfortunate.  Looks like it would have been a nifty little spot to eat. I like the attempt at a dramatic choice of perspective, but the bright light of the time of day doesn''t really work with the subject that feels like it wants to be dark and moody.', '2008-09-07 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939862, 715778, 62187, '<td valign="top">I highly doubt that''s a quote of his. A better photo would be one without the bottled water. By the way: are we aware that his name is Barack (Saddam) Hussein (Osama) Obama and his running mate is Joe (Bin Laden) Biden? Strange...</td>', 'I highly doubt that''s a quote of his. A better photo would be one without the bottled water. By the way: are we aware that his name is Barack (Saddam) Hussein (Osama) Obama and his running mate is Joe (Bin Laden) Biden? Strange...', '2008-09-07 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939864, 714915, 62187, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I liked the other one better. I wish I could point out why. I''ll go with a 9 this time. No, it''s still a 10 of a photo to me.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=707473" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/707473.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/707473.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/900/120/707473.jpg"/></a></td>', 'For some reason, I liked the other one better. I wish I could point out why. I''ll go with a 9 this time. No, it''s still a 10 of a photo to me. ', '2008-09-07 13:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939865, 715527, 97166, '<td valign="top">While I''m sure this scene was very nice to behold in person, it has lost a lot in transition to this photo.  Lighting is overly bright, the tree branch hanging down in the upper corner is a major distraction, the background is too clear and distracting due to clutter, and the pose of the horses isn''t particularly exciting, what with one being half hidden by the other, so we''re just presented with it''s behind (and not in any real artistic manner either).<br/> <br/>Perhaps you were stuck shooting this from behind a fence, or had some other barrier, I don''t know, but another angle was definitely needed for this to be a real contender in a Free Study, especially so soon after having a "horses" challenge, which have saturated the voters'' views of horses for the time being.</td>', 'While I''m sure this scene was very nice to behold in person, it has lost a lot in transition to this photo.  Lighting is overly bright, the tree branch hanging down in the upper corner is a major distraction, the background is too clear and distracting due to clutter, and the pose of the horses isn''t particularly exciting, what with one being half hidden by the other, so we''re just presented with it''s behind (and not in any real artistic manner either). Perhaps you were stuck shooting this from behind a fence, or had some other barrier, I don''t know, but another angle was definitely needed for this to be a real contender in a Free Study, especially so soon after having a "horses" challenge, which have saturated the voters'' views of horses for the time being.', '2008-09-07 13:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939866, 708798, 97166, '<td valign="top">The loss of the pupils in the eyes due to the high mirror effect kind of renders this photo a little eerie.  Other than tha, it''s nice shot</td>', 'The loss of the pupils in the eyes due to the high mirror effect kind of renders this photo a little eerie.  Other than tha, it''s nice shot', '2008-09-07 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939871, 716754, 97166, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the title was absolutely necessary here.  The scene is already brobdingnagian, the title doesn''t need to be.</td>', 'Not sure that the title was absolutely necessary here.  The scene is already brobdingnagian, the title doesn''t need to be.', '2008-09-07 13:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939872, 716413, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering what caused you to decide on a Black &amp; White conversion. It''s a lovely photo that I''m pretty sure is the lower part of the North American Nebula: 10</td>', 'I''m wondering what caused you to decide on a Black & White conversion. It''s a lovely photo that I''m pretty sure is the lower part of the North American Nebula: 10', '2008-09-07 13:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939875, 716615, 97166, '<td valign="top">You''ve curiously left too much white spce behind her, shunting the action of the scene to the corner of the frame.  Your angle also means part of her face is unnecessarily blocked in this case.  Shooting from a higher angle, and making sure your framing allows us to see as much of the action of the shot as possible would have improved this.</td>', 'You''ve curiously left too much white spce behind her, shunting the action of the scene to the corner of the frame.  Your angle also means part of her face is unnecessarily blocked in this case.  Shooting from a higher angle, and making sure your framing allows us to see as much of the action of the shot as possible would have improved this.', '2008-09-07 13:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939876, 706085, 97166, '<td valign="top">A nice static shot of an owl, but not much more in my eyes.</td>', 'A nice static shot of an owl, but not much more in my eyes.', '2008-09-07 13:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939877, 712122, 97166, '<td valign="top">a little over-saturated for my tastes.</td>', 'a little over-saturated for my tastes.', '2008-09-07 13:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939878, 710791, 97166, '<td valign="top">Uniquely colored considering the nature of the scene.  We''re presented with these old, dilapidated textures, but then hit in the face with bright pinks and oranges. It''s stunning in its decay.</td>', 'Uniquely colored considering the nature of the scene.  We''re presented with these old, dilapidated textures, but then hit in the face with bright pinks and oranges. It''s stunning in its decay.', '2008-09-07 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939879, 716662, 97166, '<td valign="top">Cloned!<br/> <br/>Just kidding.</td>', 'Cloned! Just kidding.', '2008-09-07 13:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939880, 716747, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice panning.  At the speeds he was going, I bet it too more than a few shots.<br/> <br/>I like the wide-screen presentation too.</td>', 'Nice panning.  At the speeds he was going, I bet it too more than a few shots. I like the wide-screen presentation too.', '2008-09-07 13:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939883, 716725, 97166, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to realize what those were.  Nice tones throughout, and a decent photojournalist look.</td>', 'Took me a minute to realize what those were.  Nice tones throughout, and a decent photojournalist look.', '2008-09-07 13:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939884, 715066, 97166, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for a B&amp;W conversion here.  The toning is nice for the most part (some harsh blow-outs in the grass). Composition is classic.  Something about this just cries out for color though.</td>', 'Interesting choice for a B&W conversion here.  The toning is nice for the most part (some harsh blow-outs in the grass). Composition is classic.  Something about this just cries out for color though.', '2008-09-07 13:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939885, 716749, 97166, '<td valign="top">Not a bad use of selective desat, but the subject remains just too far away.</td>', 'Not a bad use of selective desat, but the subject remains just too far away.', '2008-09-07 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939887, 715801, 97166, '<td valign="top">Cute and classic newborn shot.  Lacks any really extra punch for DPC though, I imagine.</td>', 'Cute and classic newborn shot.  Lacks any really extra punch for DPC though, I imagine.', '2008-09-07 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939890, 713047, 97166, '<td valign="top">Silky smooth pretty much everywhere until you hit the shadows of the yellow, and then bang, hit by some pretty prominent grain/noise.  While this wouldn''t be a major issue in many other pictures, the contrast between it and the almost unnatural smoothness of the white is a shame.</td>', 'Silky smooth pretty much everywhere until you hit the shadows of the yellow, and then bang, hit by some pretty prominent grain/noise.  While this wouldn''t be a major issue in many other pictures, the contrast between it and the almost unnatural smoothness of the white is a shame.', '2008-09-07 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939891, 712722, 97166, '<td valign="top">A nice scenebut it''s too small.</td>', 'A nice scenebut it''s too small.', '2008-09-07 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939896, 714321, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m not really feeling the choice of sepia toning her.  Fog is cool and damp, sepia toning is warm.  There''s a conflict there</td>', 'I''m not really feeling the choice of sepia toning her.  Fog is cool and damp, sepia toning is warm.  There''s a conflict there', '2008-09-07 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939901, 709789, 97166, '<td valign="top">This has a feeling to it of over-sharpening due to focus or camera-movement issues.</td>', 'This has a feeling to it of over-sharpening due to focus or camera-movement issues.', '2008-09-07 14:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939916, 716638, 97166, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun shot, I keep coming back to it.  Driving fast down a road like this in a car like that would freak the hell out of me.</td>', 'This is such a fun shot, I keep coming back to it.  Driving fast down a road like this in a car like that would freak the hell out of me.', '2008-09-07 14:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939920, 710155, 97166, '<td valign="top">I like this shot more and more every time I see it.  There''s drama, yet it is subtle enough that it doesn''t take over the shot.  The use of the DOF is exquisite. (and I''m in trouble in Shallow DOF IV if shots like this are the norm there).  Wonderful, wonderful non-classic portrait.</td>', 'I like this shot more and more every time I see it.  There''s drama, yet it is subtle enough that it doesn''t take over the shot.  The use of the DOF is exquisite. (and I''m in trouble in Shallow DOF IV if shots like this are the norm there).  Wonderful, wonderful non-classic portrait.', '2008-09-07 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4939921, 716583, 97166, '<td valign="top">Highlights are blown, noise everywhere, horizon is tilted...<br/> <br/>but this shot gets high marks and is simply gorgeous nonetheless.</td>', 'Highlights are blown, noise everywhere, horizon is tilted... but this shot gets high marks and is simply gorgeous nonetheless.', '2008-09-07 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940080, 716701, 35804, '<td valign="top">There is something so magnificent about the light in this image. It is a true pleasure looking at the cool and subdued tones...very nice work.</td>', 'There is something so magnificent about the light in this image. It is a true pleasure looking at the cool and subdued tones...very nice work.', '2008-09-07 15:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940082, 716905, 35804, '<td valign="top">The longer I look at this the more I come to love that huge poofy cloud. A perfect day indeed.</td>', 'The longer I look at this the more I come to love that huge poofy cloud. A perfect day indeed.', '2008-09-07 15:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940092, 715331, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love this...such a gentle photograph...I get so tired of being hit on the head with overwrought color and "eye candy"...this is an image that deserves perusing and ambling...and the warm platinum tones are perfection. This whole thing is perfection...title included.</td>', 'I love this...such a gentle photograph...I get so tired of being hit on the head with overwrought color and "eye candy"...this is an image that deserves perusing and ambling...and the warm platinum tones are perfection. This whole thing is perfection...title included.', '2008-09-07 16:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940123, 716746, 22538, '<td valign="top">nicely (over)exposed</td>', 'nicely (over)exposed', '2008-09-07 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940124, 715797, 22538, '<td valign="top">a touch oversaturated for me...</td>', 'a touch oversaturated for me...', '2008-09-07 16:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940128, 716860, 22538, '<td valign="top">really atmospheric shot</td>', 'really atmospheric shot', '2008-09-07 16:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4940130, 716878, 75532, '<td valign="top">stunning 9</td>', 'stunning 9', '2008-09-07 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
