(4940307, 716709, 50695, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful capture of a moment so quickly gone. The exposure is perfect, absolutely perfect. 9</td>', 'What a beautiful capture of a moment so quickly gone. The exposure is perfect, absolutely perfect. 9', '2008-09-07 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
