(4942621, 716693, 22538, '<td valign="top">Even the voting pattern is out of usual. Mostly, when bugs, birds, beaches or beasts are captured, it appears to follow some kind of Gaussian-like curve. In this case, 10''s are clearly far more frequent than one would expect on that basis only. Perhaps something extraordinary clicked there with these eight viewers.</td>', 'Even the voting pattern is out of usual. Mostly, when bugs, birds, beaches or beasts are captured, it appears to follow some kind of Gaussian-like curve. In this case, 10''s are clearly far more frequent than one would expect on that basis only. Perhaps something extraordinary clicked there with these eight viewers.', '2008-09-08 16:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
