(4945497, 714947, 12253, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot, and a waaayyy too low score for it!  I can''t imagine what the voters were thinking. <br/> <br/>The only thing I can see at all that makes this less than perfect is the low contrast BG, particularly the light areas.  They are too grayish, if you can see what I mean.<br/> <br/>But that also helps to bring her out to the forefrount, and gives it a soft look.  It should have done much better, but that''s not important--great shot Judy!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot, and a waaayyy too low score for it!  I can''t imagine what the voters were thinking.  The only thing I can see at all that makes this less than perfect is the low contrast BG, particularly the light areas.  They are too grayish, if you can see what I mean. But that also helps to bring her out to the forefrount, and gives it a soft look.  It should have done much better, but that''s not important--great shot Judy!', '2008-09-09 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 0),
