(4946947, 712263, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh - I remember this from voting.  It''s one of those picures that jumps out and catches your attention.  I think your work is too artsy for the average DPC voter.  It reminds me more of the stuff that I have seen at JPG Magazine.  You ought to check that sight out and have your pics get some love there.  Fun catch and funky restaurant!</td>', 'heh - I remember this from voting.  It''s one of those picures that jumps out and catches your attention.  I think your work is too artsy for the average DPC voter.  It reminds me more of the stuff that I have seen at JPG Magazine.  You ought to check that sight out and have your pics get some love there.  Fun catch and funky restaurant!', '2008-09-10 10:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4947087, 712263, 35545, '<td valign="top">I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67697" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">colorcarnival</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=44877" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">redjulep</a> -- a great shot, but not for your average DPC-er.  I also agree with the suggestion to check-out <a href="//www.jpgmag.com/photos/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JPG Magazine</a>.  I have stuff over there, and what gets ignored here, usually does very well there, and vice-versa.  Go figure.</td>', 'I agree with  colorcarnival and  redjulep -- a great shot, but not for your average DPC-er.  I also agree with the suggestion to check-out JPG Magazine.  I have stuff over there, and what gets ignored here, usually does very well there, and vice-versa.  Go figure.', '2008-09-10 11:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4947306, 716610, 9114, '<td valign="top">This is interesting Irene. If you do glass and abstracts you win in the 1st, 2nd or 3rd place. If you try to branch out to something new you drop to 132nd place. I don''t understand that.<br/>I would have given this a 10. I really like it<br/>Debbi</td>', 'This is interesting Irene. If you do glass and abstracts you win in the 1st, 2nd or 3rd place. If you try to branch out to something new you drop to 132nd place. I don''t understand that.I would have given this a 10. I really like itDebbi', '2008-09-10 12:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4947776, 716583, 57060, '<td valign="top">agree with comments - interesting composition, kinda weird technicals on it but I know how that happens. Fun shot, would be great to see this as a series in order to make more sense of it.</td>', 'agree with comments - interesting composition, kinda weird technicals on it but I know how that happens. Fun shot, would be great to see this as a series in order to make more sense of it.', '2008-09-10 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 0),
