(4959991, 716978, 30982, '<td valign="top">What gorgeous light!  And the rainbow is a splendid touch.  What I really like are the contrasts.  Not in tone, but in subject.  The smaller buildings against the large; the cars and indications of people against the somewhat barren structures beyond; the manmade against that wonderful sky; that looming shadow against the light.  Nifty shot!</td>', 'What gorgeous light!  And the rainbow is a splendid touch.  What I really like are the contrasts.  Not in tone, but in subject.  The smaller buildings against the large; the cars and indications of people against the somewhat barren structures beyond; the manmade against that wonderful sky; that looming shadow against the light.  Nifty shot!', '2008-09-17 13:42:49.000000', NULL, 0),
