(5013761, 716462, 55838, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  It gives the impression that it''s telling a story - could be a frame from a movie.  The down-pour and the expressions on the kids faces create interest.  This would have done much better in a photojournalism challenge - Free Study''s can be brutal.  I agree with your choice to leave the mailbox in the crop.  If you removed it then it would not be clear that these kids are on a road.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I like this shot.  It gives the impression that it''s telling a story - could be a frame from a movie.  The down-pour and the expressions on the kids faces create interest.  This would have done much better in a photojournalism challenge - Free Study''s can be brutal.  I agree with your choice to leave the mailbox in the crop.  If you removed it then it would not be clear that these kids are on a road.  Nice capture.', '2008-10-18 17:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
