(5017913, 714344, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think the two lines are great. It is like seeing double, but one is a green hill the other monkeys. Wonderful. Too bad on the score. Even without the sharp focus, it should not have scored this low.</td>', 'I think the two lines are great. It is like seeing double, but one is a green hill the other monkeys. Wonderful. Too bad on the score. Even without the sharp focus, it should not have scored this low.', '2008-10-21 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5019250, 712539, 88136, '<td valign="top">holy crap, this is amazing</td>', 'holy crap, this is amazing', '2008-10-21 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5021982, 708775, 67697, '<td valign="top">You are seriously so magical.  Your ability to enter the lives of strangers is such a gift.  These two girls are gorgeous!  I love this sweet innocent moment you got here.  The fact that the mom is going to get to have a copy of this is even more special.<br/> <br/>Just an idea for you.  Someone mentioned this to me once and I''ve been keeping it in the back of my head until the right moment presents itself.  Someone told me of his plan to do charity photoshoots at a women''s shelter or some place like that where people are temporary residents.  His motivation was like what you mentioned above:  these families probably do not have photgraphic record of their families.  I thought it was a great idea and hope to get that going here some day.  I think you''d be perfect for it :)</td>', 'You are seriously so magical.  Your ability to enter the lives of strangers is such a gift.  These two girls are gorgeous!  I love this sweet innocent moment you got here.  The fact that the mom is going to get to have a copy of this is even more special. Just an idea for you.  Someone mentioned this to me once and I''ve been keeping it in the back of my head until the right moment presents itself.  Someone told me of his plan to do charity photoshoots at a women''s shelter or some place like that where people are temporary residents.  His motivation was like what you mentioned above:  these families probably do not have photgraphic record of their families.  I thought it was a great idea and hope to get that going here some day.  I think you''d be perfect for it :)', '2008-10-23 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 0),
